{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:92492","published":"2026-10-29T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-10-30T16:45:01.885656459Z","related":["CVE-2026-111497","CVE-2026-114148"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-111497","CVE-2026-114148"],"summary":"Important: .NET 8.0 security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":".NET is a fast, lightweight and modular platform for creating cross platform applications that work on Linux, macOS and Windows. It particularly focuses on creating console applications, web applications and micro-services. .NET contains a runtime conforming to .NET Standards a set of framework libraries, an SDK containing compilers and a 'dotnet' application to drive everything.  \n\nSDK version: 8.0.133  \nRuntime version: 8.0.33  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * brotli: Out-of-Bounds Write in Google Brotli Decoder (CVE-2026-111497)\n  * dotnet8.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet11.0: dotnet10.0: ASP.NET Core Elevation of Privilege Vulnerability (CVE-2026-114148)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Update .NET 8.0 to SDK 8.0.133 and Runtime 8.0.33 [rhel-9.8.z] (JIRA:RHEL-291717)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"aspnetcore-runtime-8.0","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/aspnetcore-runtime-8.0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8.0.33-1.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:92492.json"}},{"package":{"name":"aspnetcore-runtime-dbg-8.0","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/aspnetcore-runtime-dbg-8.0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8.0.33-1.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:92492.json"}},{"pac